  m_text: '5



    Once a model has been downloaded it will appear at the origin
    point, you can interact with the model by tapping on it which brings up a menu.


    Make
    in the model manipulatable allows you to move, rotate or scale the model.


    Tap
    ''Original Scale'' to make a model 1:1 scale. Be careful though about large models,
    particularly DEMs, as these may end up being too large to interact with.


    ---


    Time
    to get started....'
