  m_text: '1



    First we need to create or join a room.


    Enter your user
    name.


    Choose whether to create a new room or join an existing room.


    If
    a new room is needed, create a name for that room and select ''Create Room''


    If
    joining a room, a list of open rooms will be displayed. Select ''Enter Room''
    to join.'
